            </note>
            <note corresp="#d20-f2" n="2" xml:id="d20-f2-content">
                <p>Department of State Publication 3646, “International Control of Atomic Energy and
                    the Prohibition of Atomic Weapons: Recommendations of the United Nations Atomic
                    Energy Commission,” released October 1949.</p>
            </note>
